constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{6}
1 ≤ arr_{i} ≤ 10^{6}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def findgroups(self, arr, n):
		c = [0, 0, 0]
		res = 0
		for el in arr:
			c[el % 3] += 1
		res += c[0] * (c[0] - 1) / 2
		res += c[1] * c[2]
		res += c[0] * (c[0] - 1) * (c[0] - 2) / 6
		res += c[1] * (c[1] - 1) * (c[1] - 2) / 6
		res += c[2] * (c[2] - 1) * (c[2] - 2) / 6
		res += c[0] * c[1] * c[2]
		return int(res)
